    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel like something i can just \"heal\" from. it feels like a stain. like no matter what good i do now, it's just a mask for what i actually am. seeing him cry while i just stood there like a statue... it's like i'm not even human. i don't think people like me actually deserve to move on or be happy. it feels wrong.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
